      "text": "Frontend: React 18 UMD FEDIT dashboard plus generated HTML/CSS/JS ODT dashboard for intake, uploads, reviewer notes, stage overrides, and status visibility\n\nBackend: local Node.js context server using http, fs, path, and child_process for intake save/update, repo checks, uploads, run/execute actions, and agent status\n\nPlanner: ODT 7-stage Node.js pipeline for requirement hardening, repo impact, tech design, code workpack, unit tests, compliance, and verification\n\nOptional GenAI: OCI prompt generation through OCI CLI with template fallback for resilient stage-prompt drafting\n\nExecution: Codex or Cline CLI sessions consume the governed prompt bundle, work against the target repo, and return diff/log/output artifacts\n\nStorage: local reports/ filesystem stores JSON, Markdown, HTML, uploads, logs, prompts, summaries, and execution evidence\n\n",
